#: src/components/pages/MethodPage.astro:211
msgid "<0>Authored XML</0> (portals with only HTML or PDF — the Rada, EDPB and DSK guidance, much of US and member-state law): the text is transcribed into a small readable schema. <1>sources verify</1> validates the schema and requires every paragraph to occur word for word in the saved original, list item for list item — a transcription cannot silently drift from what was published."
msgstr ""

#: src/components/pages/GraphPage.astro:48
msgid "<0>Double-click</0> a node, or press <1>Expand</1>, to bring in its neighbours."
msgstr ""

#: src/components/pages/MethodPage.astro:332
